  (global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 60.96 91.44 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid c7fd2c4f-0f7e-51ba-aab4-7f30e641fe68)
    (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 60.96 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
  (text "NOTES\nJP6: cut to isolate the GNSS supply (UART5_TX idle-high still back-feeds RXD)\nU14: UBX-20035208 R08: VIO_SEL open = 3.3 V I/O; V_BCKP 1.65-3.6 V; ext. gain <= 30 dB. SDA/SCL reused as ANT_DETECT/ANT_SHORT_N: CFG-I2C-ENABLED=0 (Integration manual Table 50)\nR80: leave NOT fitted: VIO_SEL to GND would select 1.8 V I/O (datasheet Table 10)\nQ11: T1: antenna supply switch (reference uses Vishay Si1016X; any small P-FET)\nR84: R7: keeps T1 off unless LNA_EN is high\nQ12: T2: LNA_EN (ANT_OFF_N) high -> antenna powered\nR81: R8: current sense / short limiter 10 ohm 0.25 W (Table 53); ~18.5 mV per 1.85 mA\nR82: R5 (Table 53)\nR83: R6: VREF = 0.9944 x V_ANT -> 'antenna present' above ~1.85 mA\nU15: U6 comparator (reference: LT6000/LT6003); zero-drift RRIO, offset <= 10 uV vs an 18.5 mV threshold\nC84: U15 decoupling\nR85: ANT_SHORT_N taken straight from the R8 low side (reference U7 buffer not needed at equal levels); 1k only limits current into the PIO\nC82: C14: bias-T capacitor (Table 52)\nL80: L3: bias-T inductor, >500 ohm at L1, >=300 mA (Table 54)\nC83: C18: DC block 47 pF 5 % C0G (Table 52)\nJ4: active patch antenna with SAW pre-filter; 50 ohm CPWG trace" (at 15 103.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b1b817f1-45de-5725-bd5a-97d1ee33a240))
)
